# [Dockerfile Code]($section.id('dockerfile'))
```dockerfile
# syntax=docker/dockerfile:1
ARG VERSION=latest
FROM alpine:${VERSION} AS build
COPY --chown=1000:1000 . .
RUN printf '%s' "<&> ${VERSION}" && echo done
CMD ["/bin/app", "--serve"]
```

Malformed:

```dockerfile
FROM alpine AS
RUN echo "unterminated ${NAME} <&>
```

Incomplete:

```dockerfile
RUN echo ${NAME
```

